n your own characters with unique hair, faces, outfits and accessories \u003cbr\u003e🏡  Decorate spaces with Home Designer. Change the walls, furniture and colors \u003cbr\u003e🐶 Add pets, food, toys and silly items so each place feels like your own\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePLAY YOUR WAY\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🤘 Create your own stories. Become a chef, spa owner, rockstar, or teacher \u003cbr\u003e🏭  Mix and match locations to invent your own mini games and challenges \u003cbr\u003e🚌 Move characters between homes, schools, shops and secret spots \u003cbr\u003e🏥 Try roleplay like running a pet hospital, opening a fashion studio or hosting a sleepover\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEXPLORE, DISCOVER AND COLLECT\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e💎 Find hidden gems, secret rooms and surprises in the locations\u003cbr\u003e🎁 Visit the Post Office every Friday for free gifts including furniture, outfits, decorations and pets\u003cbr\u003e🌎 Grow your world as new packs and locations are added to the in-app shop\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMADE FOR KIDS, EASY TO PLAY\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e👍  Simple, touch-first controls make it usable for all reading abilities\u003cbr\u003e🎨 No time limits or high scores. Just creative play\u003cbr\u003e🌊  Open-ended design lets kids follow their own curiosity\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSAFE, SINGLE-PLAYER AND AD-FREE\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e😊 Toca Boca World is a single-player kids\u0026#39; game, not chat and no strangers\u003cbr\u003e🤝 COPPA compliant, and carefully designed as a safe space for kids\u003cbr\u003e❌ No third-party ads ever. Play is never interrupted by adverts or pop-ups\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAWARD-WINNING FUN FROM TOCA BOCA\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur game has been recognized as App of the Year and an Editor’s Choice for its playful design and dedication to kids’ safety. Our award-winning kids game can be downloaded on phones, tablets and computers, with optional in-app purchases for families who want to expand their world. We believe in the power of play. That’s why Toca Boca World is built as a high-quality, ad-free game that lets children explore, create and imagine freely.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSTAY CONNECTED\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDiscover new locations, events and collaborations by following Toca Boca World on social media and inside the in-app shop. There’s always a new story waiting."],"Toca Boca","100,000,000+",null,"Ages 6-12",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6O0MIKi-3jljHyPUlYWFuLtH4ccoAWSYX9a-14nDbOxOclDE5Vk8WIM4Z58_1ONT6xc5fCAvHgRITZXa6ZffdQ"],null,[132,209,254,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,[null,"In-Game Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.tocaboca.tocalifeworld\u0026rdid\u003dcom.tocaboca.tocalifeworld\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["$0.49 - $199.99 per item",[0]]],[["com.pazugames.avatarworld",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VmQPgxQrxXDh0wA02MGc6uKkpQwobWF9QlUEaH3py8b3GKJuRvYiOPTbBmPvY81hrr-Y0nlMKN3-D6MCeTtx"],null,[255,121,82,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1242,2688],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/H1KmzYqxvIm5h_CsKiD2Yd2mKN1JupQcRgNYq26OSHs_987c7Pi5OUOn2ebk0tsRppVRk7No6