ious activities. Let your children imagine, create, play, and learn with over 1,500 characters across 11 different themes. \u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003e\u003ch1\u003eIMAGINE \u0026amp; UNLOCK DIFFERENT ROLES\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYour children can imagine and play different roles -- such as car racers,  or fantasy characters such as princesses in the unicorn world, pirates, fairies, and superheroes!\u003cbr\u003eEnjoy an open-ended world full of exciting themes with your family, from NATOONS, fantasy, space, city, EMOTIVERSE, LET\u0026#39;S STORY! and more. \u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003e\u003ch1\u003eBUILD CHARACTERS \u0026amp; CUSTOMIZE YOUR KIDS\u0026#39; WORLD\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWith Applaydu by Kinder, kids and parents can build their own avatars, choosing hairstyles, outfits, shoes... Let your children customize their world full of life with paintings, furniture, and other items.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003e\u003ch1\u003eCREATE TALES \u0026amp; EMERGE IN BEDTIME STORIES\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYour kids can create their own stories and adventure books by exploring different worlds in Applaydu.\u003cbr\u003eWith LET\u0026#39;S STORY! by Applaydu, let your kids imagine and build up their stories by choosing characters, locations, plots and quests. \u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003e\u003ch1\u003eLEARN THROUGH PLAY\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApplaydu by Kinder supports your kid\u0026#39;s growth from basic skills with shapes, colors, math, etc., to life skills in the avatar house such as brushing teeth, taking a shower, sorting trash and eating healthily.\u003cbr\u003eEspecially with EMOTIVERSE by Applaydu, your children can play and learn about emotions and how to define and express different feelings. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch1\u003e16 MINI-GAMES \u0026amp; INNOVATIVE AR ACTIVITIES AWAIT\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApplaydu by Kinder offers a variety of mini-games, stories and quests that keep kids engaged while reinforcing learning concep