 feeling of popping all the bubbles of the pop it anti-stress fidget toy. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWith a simple and intuitive interface, this relaxing and educational pop it fidget toys is easy to play for children of all ages. In addition, the game features sounds that tell children what letter, number or shape they have formed. Pop It is an ideal way to learn numbers, letters and shapes and learn to match words to pictures. It\u0026#39;s time to complete puzzles and enjoy the bubble squeezing effect and learn vocabulary!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eChildren can choose their favorite pop it from several categories in this sensory game:\u003cbr\u003e- Letters\u003cbr\u003e- Numbers\u003cbr\u003e- Geometric shapes\u003cbr\u003e- Words: animals, food, flowers and many more!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf you are looking for relaxing, fun and educational entertainment this children\u0026#39;s bubble pop it game is ideal for you. Besides being a stress-reducing and calming toy, with this educational version, children can even develop important skills such as memory, hand-eye coordination and attention. It is also a great way to learn first words or start writing letters and numbers.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFEATURES\u003cbr\u003e- Pop it relaxing toy puzzles. \u003cbr\u003e- Learn letters, numbers and geometric shapes.\u003cbr\u003e- Start associating words with images.\u003cbr\u003e- Develop skills such as coordination, memory and attention\u003cbr\u003e- Fun and educational game of Bubble Pop It\u003cbr\u003e- Simulates the effect of squeezing air bubbles\u003cbr\u003e- Pop It anti-stress and didactic fidget toy\u003cbr\u003e- Fidget game ideal for babies and young children\u003cbr\u003e- Sensory games\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eABOUT PLAYKIDS EDUJOY\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThank you very much for playing Edujoy games. We love creating fun and educational games for people of all ages. If you have any questions or suggestions about this game you can