null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dteaching_com.reading_com\u0026rdid\u003dteaching_com.reading_com\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dteaching_com.reading_com"]],["qgJtGmsIAhIgCh4KGHRlYWNoaW5nX2NvbS5yZWFkaW5nX2NvbRABGANKEwjbqouKxeWWAxW3w9MIHagCC4eaARMI64vUm5fllgMVpHlsBR2G9jJf+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAAiAICygIECAIQAQ\u003d\u003d"],null,[null,"\u003cb\u003eReading.com is the ground-breaking reading app for kids and phonics program brought to you by Teaching.com, a world leader in education helping over 75 million students and 1.7 million educators worldwide.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eReading.com is a fun, co-play experience designed by education experts to help your kid learn to read — with the love, care, and joy only a parent and child can share.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eChildren are 19x more likely to learn from an app when using it with a parent\u003c/b\u003e (source: Psychology Today), and Reading.com is the only reading app that is specifically designed for a parent and child to use together!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch2\u003eA RESEARCH-BACKED APP TO LEARN TO READ\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eReading.com’s phonics-based lessons are backed by research and fully scripted so \u003cb\u003eyou don’t need any special training or knowledge\u003c/b\u003e to become the most powerful teacher your child will ever have. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis is the perfect reading app for kids in preschool, kindergarten, and 1st grade. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch2\u003eGO FROM LETTER RECOGNITION TO CONFIDENT READING\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAs your kid masters more letters, sounds, and words, \u003cb\u003ethey\u0026#39;ll unlock a playful world of reading activities including interactive books, videos, reading games, and printable activities\u003c/b\u003e. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThanks to simple guided instruction, you’ll not only experience your child mastering each phonics lesson, but will also foster a lifelong love of reading you can share together.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eBy lesson 10, your kid will be reading their first book!\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch2\u003eTHE MOST MEANINGFUL (TEAM)WORK OF YOUR LIFE\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eEach phonics lesson takes just 15 - 20 minutes to complete\u003c/b\u003e and they’re designed for you and your child to go at your own pace. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLessons cover letters, letter blends, short \u0026amp; long vowel sounds, and digraphs, taking your child from basic alphabetic knowledge to reading at a late 1st grade/early 2nd grade level.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis is the easiest head start you’ll ever give your child!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch2\u003eREADING.COM - LEARN TO READ KEY FEATURES\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- 99 step-by-step phonics lessons for a grownup \u0026amp; child to do together\u003cbr\u003e- 60 decodable, digital, interactive books for kids\u003cbr\u003e- 42 videos featuring letters, letter sounds, and our ABC song: an exclusive alphabet song!\u003cbr\u003e- 3 expertly-designed reading games for independent play that practice skills in: letter recognition, letter-phoneme correlation, beginning sounds, vocabulary, letter-writing, spelling\u003cbr\u003e- Access to printable reading games \u0026amp; activities for fun offline reinforcement\u003cbr\u003e- One subscription for the whole family with up to 3 kid profiles\u003cbr\u003e- Ad-free\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch2\u003eDISCOVER DETAILS OF OUR READING PROGRAM\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e1️⃣ LEARNING LETTERS\u003cbr\u003eYour child will develop a strong foundation in letter recognition, letter-sound knowledge, and other pre-reading skills. You will guide them as they practice writing letters, develop phonemic awareness, and deepen their understanding of letter sounds through interactive games.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e2️⃣ BLENDING LETTERS\u003cbr\u003eIn this phase, your kid will use their knowledge of letter-sounds to begin blending letters together to read words. Your child will become adept at using our sound sliders to support them in decoding words with short vowel sounds and both slow \u0026amp; fast consonants.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e3️⃣ READING BOOKS\u003cbr\u003eOnce your child has a foundation in word-blending skills, it’s time to read books! Together you will read fun and engaging stories, reveal hidden pictures, and check for understanding by answering comprehension questions.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e4️⃣ ADVANCED DECODING\u003cbr\u003eIn this phase, your kid will learn about long vowel sounds, digraphs, and irregular sight words, as well as how to approach common types of punctuation.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e5️⃣ READING FLUENCY\u003cbr\u003eIn this final phase of reading development, your child will learn to read smoothly and accurately by expanding their sight word knowledge, vocabulary, and exposure to more complex text.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDownload this educational app today and help your kid learn to read!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://www.reading.com/privacy-policy/"],"Teaching.com","1,000,000+",null,"Ages up to 8",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qcaeEhNu5xGI-r6S-ZZ_F7oSSfVKZ5L8BeT2n-n6rNFvItmyHgrJWa_ulCtFza576S8GZCZ1qWEnmdWcpvksww"],null,[31,21,78,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,null,[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,[null,"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain 