on, and shapes, kids can explore over 5,000 educational games and activities with Kodi’s friends:\u003cbr\u003e• Ollo the Elephant – phonics and letter sounds\u003cbr\u003e• Reya the Red Panda – storytime and writing\u003cbr\u003e• Peck the Hummingbird – numbers and counting\u003cbr\u003e• Sandy the Dingo – puzzles, memory, and problem-solving\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAWARDS AND RECOGNITION:\u003cbr\u003eWith more than 180,000 5-star reviews, Khan Academy Kids has won the hearts of families and educators worldwide. \u003cbr\u003e• “Best kids app EVER”\u003cbr\u003e• “It’s 100% free and my kids learn so much!”\u003cbr\u003e• “If you’re looking for a HIGH quality app for your kids, this is it!”\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRecognition includes:\u003cbr\u003e• Common Sense Media – Top Rated Educational App\u003cbr\u003e• Children’s Technology Review – Editor’s Choice\u003cbr\u003e• Parents’ Choice – Gold Award Winner\u003cbr\u003e• Apple App Store – Editor’s Choice\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA LIBRARY OF STORYBOOKS AND VIDEOS:\u003cbr\u003eDiscover hundreds of kids’ books and videos for preschool, kindergarten and early elementary.\u003cbr\u003e• Explore animals, dinosaurs, science, and more with non-fiction books from National Geographic and Bellwether Media. \u003cbr\u003e• Choose “Read To Me” for read-aloud storybooks in English or Spanish. \u003cbr\u003e• Dance and sing-along with videos from Super Simple Songs! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFROM PRESCHOOL TO 2ND GRADE:\u003cbr\u003eKhan Academy Kids grows with your child, from age 2 through 8 and beyond:\u003cbr\u003e• Preschool learning games build foundational reading, math, and life skills.\u003cbr\u003e• Kindergarten activities cover phonics, sight words, writing, and early math.\u003cbr\u003e• 1st and 2nd grade lessons strengthen reading comprehension, problem-solving, and confidence.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSAFE, TRUSTED, AND ALWAYS FREE:\u003cbr\u003eCreated in partnership with the Stanford Graduate School of Education by education experts, aligned with Head Start and Common Core Standards, COPPA-compliant, and 100% free—no ads, no subscriptions. Khan Academy is a nonprofit with the mission to provide a free, world-class education for anyone, anywhere.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLEARN ANYWHERE—AT HOME, AT SCHOOL, EVEN OFFLINE:\u003cbr\u003e• At home: Khan Academy Kids is the perfect learning app for families at home. From sleepy mornings to road trips, kids and families love learning with Khan Kids. \u003cbr\u003e• For homeschool: Families that homeschool also enjoy our standards-aligned, educational kids games and lessons for kids.\u003cbr\u003e• At school: In-app Teacher Tools help preschool and elementary school teachers create assignments, track student progress, and make the most of small-group and whole-group learning.\u003cbr\u003e• On the go: No wifi? No problem! Download books and games for learning on the go. Perfect for car trips, waiting rooms, or cozy mornings at home.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSTART YOUR LEARNING ADVENTURE TODAY\u003cbr\u003eDownload Khan Academy Kids and watch your child discover, play, and grow. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eJOIN OUR COMMUNITIES FOR FAMILIES AND TEACHERS\u003cbr\u003eFollow @khankids on Instagram, TikTok, and YouTube. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eKHAN ACADEMY:\u003cbr\u003eKhan Academy is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization with the mission to provide a free, world-class education to anyone, anywhere. Khan Academy Kids was created by early learning experts from Duck Duck Moose who created 22 preschool games and won 22 Parents’ Choice Awards, 19 Children’s Technology Review Awards and a KAPi award for Best Children’s App. Khan Academy Kids is 100% free with no ads or subscriptions."],"Khan Academy","10,000,000+",null,"Ages up to 8",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tuxmr0BrrgZLe-Elj8Y8qZHuVgm3IFKgOYl9ENqgIB5Q06n9973kMoeHUYPmFoL-5pbQe9gTDLC1iZc00xSGW1s"],null,[254,254,