cbr\u003e🚗 Adventures with cars and trucks for little fans of racing\u003cbr\u003e🎵 Kids music, songs and interactive adventures\u003cbr\u003e📥 Offline mode with Fun Pass: download episodes and watch without Wi-Fi, perfect for trips\u003cbr\u003e🆕 New kids videos and shows added every week\u003cbr\u003e🎁 Exclusive episodes you will not find on YouTube\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🎮 EDUCATIONAL GAMES FOR KIDS AND TODDLERS\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMini games with Vlad and Niki build real skills while children play:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🚗 Car games and driving games: truck driving and toddler racing with the boys\u003cbr\u003e🍕 Cooking games and ice cream games: make pizza and sweet desserts\u003cbr\u003e🛒 Supermarket games and shopping games: educational grocery shopping fun\u003cbr\u003e🦸 Superhero games: suit up and save the day\u003cbr\u003e🎨 Coloring and colors games: creative skills for little artists\u003cbr\u003e🧩 Puzzle, matching games and shape games: match shapes, learn colors and train logic and memory\u003cbr\u003e🔤 Easy English: english learning games with simple phrases, a fun way to learn English for kids\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEvery interactive game develops cognitive skills, attention and creativity. These preschool activities are made for 2 year olds, 3 year olds, 4 year olds and 5 year olds, with simple controls for little hands.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e👨\u200d👩\u200d👦 A SAFE KIDS APP PARENTS TRUST\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🎓 Teacher Approved on Google Play\u003cbr\u003e👶 Educational app designed for toddlers and preschoolers\u003cbr\u003e🔗 No external links inside the kids zone\u003cbr\u003e👆 Simple navigation your child can use on their own\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🎟️ GO FURTHER WITH FUN PASS\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe app is free to try with selected videos and mini games. Fun Pass unlocks the full experience:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🔓 All games, selfie videos and the entire video library\u003cbr\u003e📞 Coins for AI calls w