ups, after school, or family dinners!\u003cbr\u003eSurprise Me! option delivers at a different time every day outside of school hours.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eMEET YOUR GAME SHOW HOSTS, MINDY AND GUY RAZ!\u003cbr\u003eFeaturing fan-favorite podcast hosts, Mindy Thomas and Guy Raz \u003cbr\u003eHilarious voices, graphics, catchphrases, and character art! \u003cbr\u003eIf kids aren’t fans already, they will be as soon as they play.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTHE TIME TO WOW IS NOW… OR LATER!\u003cbr\u003eFun alerts when a new game is added!\u003cbr\u003eKids can play right away, or save the game for later\u003cbr\u003eSet up the Tinkercast tile on your kid’s Wear OS watch to quickly begin or replay today\u0026#39;s game\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSPECIAL GAMES FOR SPECIAL DAYS, SEASONS, AND EVENTS!\u003cbr\u003eFun-in-the-sun science for summer!\u003cbr\u003eBack to school brain-busters\u003cbr\u003eSilly-scary questions for Halloween\u003cbr\u003eA blizzard of WOWs for Winter\u003cbr\u003eCollect at least one seasonal badge every month and science-themed badges all year long\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWOW, WHAT A STREAK! YOU EARNED A BADGE\u003cbr\u003eKids earn streaks when they play every day — and when they play every week! \u003cbr\u003eGet a digital puzzle piece every time you play\u003cbr\u003eCollect all the pieces in a category and earn a badge\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTEACHER RESOURCES\u003cbr\u003eSign up for TinkerClass, our FREE podcast-based learning platform for teachers!\u003cbr\u003ePlay Two Whats?! And A Wow! in your classroom\u003cbr\u003eGet your students listening, laughing, and learning while they build scientific thinking and 21st-century skills\u003cbr\u003eVisit TinkerClass.com to find out how\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePRIVACY\u003cbr\u003eTinkercast is committed to creating a safe and secure environment for kids to play and learn across our platforms. This Two Whats?! And A Wow! app will not collect any personally identifiable information and does not include any third-party links. If you would like to learn more about TINKERCAST’S privacy policy, visit https://tinkercast.com/privacy-policy/.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eABOUT TINKERCAST \u003cbr\u003eFounded in 2017, Tinkercast is an audio-first children’s media company with content that has been downloaded more than 230 million times. Its flagship program ‘Wow in the World’ has expanded into a #1 New York Times-best selling book series, a multi-city live tour, a YouTube channel with millions of monthly views, and an in-school program, TinkerClass. Other Tinkercast podcasts include ‘Once Upon a Beat’, a podcast that puts a hip-hop spin on fairy tales and fables, ‘Who, When, Wow: Mystery Edition!’’ which explores history’s mysteries; and ‘Flip \u0026amp; Moz’ which features earth’s amazing animals. Visit www.tinkercast.com and follow @wowintheworld.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eADD MORE WOW TO YOUR WORLD!\u003cbr\u003eVisit Tinkercast.com to explore our podcasts, including Wow in the World, the #1 Science podcast for kids!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eQUESTIONS?\u003cbr\u003eContact us at hello@tinkercast.com with any questions about this app or our podcasts!"],"Tinkercast","100,000+",null,"Ages 6-12",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/s0RjCKb-yKcHrldlDNnnu6_Y4zlFm6xMXMlj_JIftXyB_Qj0OGr0JPLyqK9nt6kE5Wn5Xn9UIGYveeM-9pDTus4"],null,[32,156,251,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,null,[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,[null,"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language."],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41