, countries, cities, nature, colors, shapes, art, music, and printable activities. New educational games and puzzles are added regularly.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCreated by educators and psychologists\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor more than eight years, our team has designed learning games for kids that are clear, engaging, and age-appropriate. LogicLike encourages children to think, test ideas, learn from mistakes, and keep going.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhy families choose LogicLike\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• 6,200+ educational activities and puzzles\u003cbr\u003e• Learning content for children ages 3-8\u003cbr\u003e• Activities for preschool, kindergarten, and Grades 1-2\u003cbr\u003e• Voiceovers, hints, and colorful visuals\u003cbr\u003e• Progress features and solution review\u003cbr\u003e• Certificates and printable activities\u003cbr\u003e• Built-in reminders for healthy learning breaks\u003cbr\u003e• New content added regularly\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSome activities are available for free, so families can explore LogicLike before choosing a subscription.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDesigned for children ages 2-8, from preschool and kindergarten through Grades 1-2.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePrivacy policy: https://logiclike.com/en/docs/privacy-app\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTerms of service: https://logiclike.com/en/docs/public-app\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eQuestions? Email us at office@logiclike.com"],"Massiana - Educational Games","10,000,000+",null,"Ages up to 8",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KjCMN62HoYzS0Cwe1-aiLQWyg79AirdUQuN0nW-ibM_bze2n74ZGhwkSVGCRH6phKR7PGBP0CxFHtsneq1cb8Q"],null,[74,255,253,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,[null,"In-Game Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings